abstract: >-
  ahead-rev-sim provides instantiated information-effect analysis, exact
  reversible execution proofs, workload custody, provider-neutral physical
  compute interfaces, scale and venue receipts, causal synchronization, and
  complete-system Energy, Volume, and Performance qualification for RISC-V and
  heterogeneous physical-compute research.
keywords:
